arner declined to commit.\n\nEvery major race rater, from Cook to Sabato, places the contest in the Solid or Safe Democratic column, and prediction markets price Warner's chances at 97 to 98 percent. Virginia's modest Democratic lean, Warner's incumbency, and the funding gap all point the same direction. The main uncertainty is the absence of recent general-election polling, but the available evidence leaves little doubt about the likely outcome.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9899, "margin": 15.82}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.989, "margin": 16.0}]}